.TH SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_DEBUG 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_DEBUG \- A variable controlling whether to enable Direct3D 11+\(aqs Debug Layer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_DEBUG \(dqSDL_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_DEBUG\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This variable does not have any effect on the Direct3D 9 based renderer\[char46]
.PP
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq0\(dq: Disable Debug Layer use\[char46] (default)
.PP
\(bu \(dq1\(dq: Enable Debug Layer use\[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before creating a renderer\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

